                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e02c8f3a-a2e4-3af8-974e-59652e0332d5",
                        "entry_id": "f2a9c370-6662-36e8-8af0-2ce1a16cabfa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жидкость, вода или её испарения, содержащиеся в чём-либо или на чём-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31f2ffa4-7eb8-4093-9713-d721b5bb6d9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2a9c370-6662-36e8-8af0-2ce1a16cabfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "e02c8f3a-a2e4-3af8-974e-59652e0332d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "moisture",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "moisture",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                        "entry_id": "7189ee25-b302-3148-ae89-3590a3969bd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which moistens or makes damp or wet; exuding fluid; liquid in small quantity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57aeb787-8a4b-48c5-b3e4-7fdb26170aa4",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "drops / beads of moisture"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a83e8a-16e5-41fa-aafc-e67a6ae697d6",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "I cannot weep; for all my body’s moisture\nScarce serves to quench my furnace-burning heart:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3a353ad-e4ad-401d-8485-278198904756",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "And some [seed] fell upon a rock; and as soon as it was sprung up, it withered away, because it lacked moisture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cfff055-8bab-459b-937b-bbf7b3b235d4",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "[…] Nicholas Nickleby’s eyes were dimmed with a moisture that might have been taken for tears."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b8e7cd-b83a-44cb-ab89-0034d4a0d22e",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "[…] as she arched her neck she actually licked her lips like an animal, till I could see in the moonlight the moisture shining on the scarlet lips and on the red tongue as it lapped the white sharp teeth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82789d53-735e-4db3-bb98-f3cd78226c8f",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c1e84b-b428-3e48-9632-e228a5fbd88f",
                                                "text": "The sage—low-growing and shrubby—could hold its place on the mountain slopes and on the plains, and within its small gray leaves it could hold moisture enough to defy the thieving winds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "321b9422-d08f-33e4-a0a7-8e2206a30051",
                                        "entry_id": "7189ee25-b302-3148-ae89-3590a3969bd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being moist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37fdcee0-d170-4de1-aa4d-9b79501c7fa2",
                                                "sense_id": "321b9422-d08f-33e4-a0a7-8e2206a30051",
                                                "text": "[…] all Exclusion of Open Aire, (which is euer Predatory) maintaineth the Body in his first Freshnesse, and Moisture:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3a494ac-32ee-4aba-8b8b-94f9cf32fc33",
                                                "sense_id": "321b9422-d08f-33e4-a0a7-8e2206a30051",
                                                "text": "Such was the discord, which did first disperse\nForme, order, beauty through the universe;\nWhile drynesse moisture, coldnesse heat resists,\nAll that we have, and that we are subsists:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955ba233-a332-426b-94f8-23620f4d19a2",
                                                "sense_id": "321b9422-d08f-33e4-a0a7-8e2206a30051",
                                                "text": "[The organs of touch are excited] by the unceasing variations of the heat, moisture, and pressure of the atmosphere;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dc5c016-6a4b-34a9-a0ac-1820fd436a06",
                                        "entry_id": "7189ee25-b302-3148-ae89-3590a3969bd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skin moisture noted as dry, moist, clammy, or diaphoretic as part of the skin signs assessment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9e79f92-b99b-43ce-9a1f-d249ca2b5ada",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2a9c370-6662-36e8-8af0-2ce1a16cabfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "e02c8f3a-a2e4-3af8-974e-59652e0332d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Feuchtigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Feuchtigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e5cbc2-9b5d-3856-950a-5237a981b7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zustand, feucht zu sein; Vorhandensein von Wasser (oder anderen Flüssigkeiten) in geringen Mengen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2309f944-0c32-46ac-b3e1-0ebcc8955f1d",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "Die Feuchtigkeit in den Zimmerwänden kann zur Schimmelbildung führen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80809574-c141-4eaf-a92b-e5c622616722",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "Bei Feuchtigkeit auf dem Boden kann man leicht darauf/darin ausrutschen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f59c69b3-4ede-47cb-b2b9-815ba914fb4e",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "„Neben Feuchtigkeit und Luftverschmutzung haben Mikroorganismen einen bedeutenden Anteil am Zerfall alter Wandgemälde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3278fb23-9f20-438c-a0dd-4cbb8371b873",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "„Die Feuchtigkeit des Holzes drang durch die Hosen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df05250e-2081-4d48-b364-aacedb5168dd",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "„Es taut heftig, die Wiese wird feucht, aber auch die Feuchtigkeit können die Menschen hier vertragen, daran sind sie von Jugend auf gewöhnt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "872d966e-c044-485f-a7b7-0bbdeef4042e",
                                                "sense_id": "4b8c78e9-a848-3250-a5e8-f50783310322",
                                                "text": "„Es sah so aus, als sei Feuchtigkeit in der Luft.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7d2a1568-42c7-41b2-86d2-479976e2a042",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2a9c370-6662-36e8-8af0-2ce1a16cabfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "e02c8f3a-a2e4-3af8-974e-59652e0332d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Feuchte",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Feuchte",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53bd0249-e3bc-3d24-9ab3-67dfee9e2a20",
                                        "entry_id": "582e92f1-3f79-3ff4-901e-169bc0ba6ace",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vorhandensein von Wasser (oder anderen Flüssigkeiten) meistens in der Luft"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ff2a0fe-1ea6-4b1b-8c8c-d897a4dc963f",
                                                "sense_id": "53bd0249-e3bc-3d24-9ab3-67dfee9e2a20",
                                                "text": "Bei zu hoher Feuchte in der Luft kann man Rheuma bekommen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "396d7779-36ea-436c-aff6-d16898d9a25a",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2a9c370-6662-36e8-8af0-2ce1a16cabfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "e02c8f3a-a2e4-3af8-974e-59652e0332d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "humidité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humidité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualité de ce qui est humide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87456707-e8db-466f-a089-3d2d67847c3b",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Le soir était venu. Nicole frotta plusieurs allumettes sur le plancher ; mais l’humidité s'opposait à leur inflammation, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fecd195-26e6-490b-96a5-1588f51fd213",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Christophe Michalak — encore un pâtissier canon ! — conseille de saupoudrer le tiramisu de sucre glace avant de le recouvrir de cacao ; la couche de sucre va absorber l’humidité de la crème, laissant le cacao impec…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bae4b2d1-d3f1-4398-b4de-d9d38850c3bf",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "Je me livrais souvent à la pêche. L’humidité avait enlevé beaucoup d’élasticité à mon arc et je préférais harponner les dorades lorsqu’elles passaient à ma portée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f165113-330f-4935-a234-a3d5ded38e20",
                                                "sense_id": "1580ebae-cb10-3de1-97e9-61f70a6e19f4",
                                                "text": "La mesure de la teneur en humidité d’un sol et la force de rétention de l’eau par celui-ci revêtent une grande importance pour l’aménagement des bassins versants et l’hydrologie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eau atmosphérique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e6cd02-5b38-431e-a087-649ed9b70eee",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                                "text": "[…] ; je descendis à la lueur des flambeaux dans cette habitation de gnomes, enfoncée sous terre d'environ quatre vingt pieds ; mais l’humidité, la fraicheur et la fumée des torches abrégèrent ma promenade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b43c56-e1fa-4698-b974-d373dcabdd94",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0690f1-f150-3a3b-b15a-a782ac3c2d4f",
                                                "text": "Le ciel était nuageux, l’humidité pénétrante. Entre des éclaircies de soleil, des averses tombaient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trace d’eau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee11d72d-0c29-4940-a6b5-1f5141c89c93",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Je m’arrêtai un instant sur un banc ruisselant de pluie, et tel était mon accablement que je ne sentais point l’humidité froide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77986e7b-829f-46da-a7be-097eee7bd951",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Les murs ruisselaient d’humidité, secrétaient des roupies, distillaient des gouttes de café noir […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ad522c9-94ec-4206-a925-21fcefbcf834",
                                                "sense_id": "55864ab3-84ce-332e-8747-86fbdb818769",
                                                "text": "Lo… installait maintenant sur le sol une planche noire, suintante d’humidité, souillée et gluante des vomissures laissées sans doute par d’autres « clients »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dde1d6e-83ce-379d-a8f5-aefb69054ac5",
                                        "entry_id": "8a85884c-c5b9-36ae-b9a5-d5ac55e4aae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lieu humide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe5a6542-6ef2-4c36-aae0-a5da1bee7e7f",
                                                "sense_id": "8dde1d6e-83ce-379d-a8f5-aefb69054ac5",
                                                "text": "Le désert solognot se confirme et semble se complaire dans son isolement comme au temps où marécages et autres humidités l’écartaient du reste du monde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
